==Battleground==
*4 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Baron Face]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Countess Koryessa]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Yellow Strike (Combo)|Yellow Strike]], then spam [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] and [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Green Nyanko Rangers]]. Every enemy here gets repeatedly Frozen to death.

